unches and relaunches scale with the requested work[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]Launching or relaunching one or several epics spends seconds on [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]local preparation instead of minutes rescanning agent history, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]while preserving active workers, exact ownership checks, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]publication barriers, and partial-launch recovery.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]6[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]6[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202609/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]fast_epic_launches.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Establish launch cost and safety baselines[/bold #D7AFFF]                    [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]measure[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]measure: add nested launch timing and an isolated history-scale [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]benchmark that separates discovery, cleanup, reservation, publication, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]spawning, and admission.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Implement shared batch ownership and cleanup planning[/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]core-batch[dim] · [dim][/dim]after measure[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core-batch: add Rust contracts for coherent ownership snapshots, batch [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]cleanup closure, expected-owner guards, and bulk reservation decisions [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]with PyO3 coverage.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Make reservation transactions reuse one fresh view[/bold #D7AFFF]            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]registry-batch[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core-batch[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]registry-b